# Keep the Augment semantic index focused. Syntax = .gitignore globs.

# Archived DELTA specs only. Each is a near-verbatim copy of a spec already
# promoted into openspec/specs/, so indexing both made a single query return
# 3-4 identical hits and pushed real code out of the results.
# The sibling proposal.md / design.md / tasks.md stay indexed on purpose —
# they hold decision rationale that exists nowhere else.
openspec/changes/archive/*/specs/

# Build output
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Binary assets (no text to retrieve; generator script stays indexed)
icons/*.png
icons/*.ico
